  <ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock id="f-17" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Use this Space to Enter any Important Changes During the Quarter/Year&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;1) N/A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;2) N/A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;3) N/A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:125%"&gt;4) During the year, Targa Badlands LLC was involved in a regulatory proceeding before the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission (FERC) concerning the continued applicability of previously granted waivers from the filing and reporting requirements of the Interstate Commerce Act, including the requirement to file FERC Form No. 6. On August 7, 2025, in Opinion No. 592 (Docket No. OR23&#8209;2&#8209;000), FERC affirmed an administrative law judge&#8217;s initial decision finding that Targa Badlands no longer qualified for its temporary waivers. The Commission determined that conditions underlying Targa Badlands&#8217; previously granted waivers were no longer satisfied. As a result, FERC revoked the waivers and required Targa Badlands to comply with the Commission&#8217;s tariff&#8209;filing and financial reporting regulations going forward. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:125%"&gt;A rate proceeding stemming from this matter remains pending before the Commission as of year&#8209;end, and the ultimate outcome could affect the rates, terms, and conditions applicable to Targa Badlands&#8217; jurisdictional transportation services. Management will comply with all applicable Commission directives and reporting requirements as the proceeding continues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;5) N/A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock>
  <ferc:ReportDate id="f-18" contextRef="c-1">2026-04-17</ferc:ReportDate>
  <ferc:ReportPeriod id="f-19" contextRef="c-1">Q4</ferc:ReportPeriod>
  <ferc:NameOfPipelineCompanyMakingReport id="f-20" contextRef="c-1">Targa Badlands LLC</ferc:NameOfPipelineCompanyMakingReport>
  <ferc:RespondentLegalName id="f-21" contextRef="c-1">Targa Badlands LLC</ferc:RespondentLegalName>
  <ferc:ReportDate id="f-22" contextRef="c-1">2026-04-17</ferc:ReportDate>
  <ferc:ReportPeriod id="f-23" contextRef="c-1">Q4</ferc:ReportPeriod>
  <ferc:NameOfPipelineCompanyMakingReport id="f-24" contextRef="c-1">Targa Badlands LLC</ferc:NameOfPipelineCompanyMakingReport>
  <ferc:RespondentLegalName id="f-25" contextRef="c-1">Targa Badlands LLC</ferc:RespondentLegalName>
